<div type="source" rend="" xml:id="div0027" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete"><pb n="487"/><sourceTitle type="main"><source>Fra</source> Den nye Børneven</sourceTitle> <sourceTitle type="sub">Illustreret Tidsskrift for Børn</sourceTitle> <sourceDate>1850</sourceDate></div>
               
<pb n="488"/><head type="main"><seg target="txtcmnt-488-01" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Fugl Phønix--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: ifølge græsk mytologi en fugl, som efter en vis tid brænder sig selv op, men derpå genopstår af sin egen aske.-->Fugl <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144619+0200" content="Phønix"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144619+0200"?>Føniks<?oxy_insert_end?></seg></head>

<p rend="noIndent" xml:id="p_00001" part="N">I <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144633+0200" content="p"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144632+0200"?>P<?oxy_insert_end?>aradisets <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144637+0200" content="h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144637+0200"?>H<?oxy_insert_end?>ave, under kundskabstræet stod en rosenhæk<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144825+0200"?>.<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144826+0200" content="; h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144826+0200"?> H<?oxy_insert_end?>er, i den første rose, fødtes en fugl, dens flugt var som lysets, dejlig dens farve, herlig dens sang!</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00002" part="N">Men da Eva brød kundskabens frugt<?oxy_comment_start author="fgj" timestamp="20231221T125614+0100" comment="komma ind igen"?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144848+0200" content=","?><?oxy_comment_end?> da hun og Adam joges fra <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144856+0200" content="p"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144855+0200"?>P<?oxy_insert_end?>aradisets <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144859+0200" content="h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144858+0200"?>H<?oxy_insert_end?>ave, faldt fra <seg target="txtcmnt-488-02" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Straffe-Englen(s)--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: hentydning til ærkeengelen Gabriel, som uddrev Adam og Eva fra Paradisets Have efter syndefaldet.-->straffe<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144904+0200" content="-"?>englens</seg> flammesværd en gnist i fuglens rede og antændte den. Fuglen døde i flammerne, men fra det røde æg fløj en ny, den eneste, den altid eneste Fugl <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144648+0200" content="Phønix"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144648+0200"?>Føniks<?oxy_insert_end?>. Sagnet melder<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145003+0200" content=","?> at den bygger i <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144640+0200" content="a"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144640+0200"?>A<?oxy_insert_end?>rabien<?oxy_comment_start author="fgj" timestamp="20231221T125651+0100" comment="komma ud"?>, <?oxy_comment_end?>og hvert hundred<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145024+0200"?>e<?oxy_insert_end?> år brænder sig selv op i sin rede, og at en ny <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144957+0200" content="f"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144957+0200"?>F<?oxy_insert_end?>øniks, den eneste i verden, flyver ud fra det røde æg.</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00003" part="N">Fuglen omflagrer os, hurtig som lyset, dejlig i farve, herlig i sang. Når mo<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145054+0200"?>ren<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145057+0200" content="deren"?> sidder ved barnets vugge, er den ved hovedpuden og slår med vingerne en glorie om barnets hoved. Den flyver gennem nøjsomhedens stue, og der er solglans derinde, den fattige <seg target="txtcmnt-488-03" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Dragkiste--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: kommode eller kiste med store skuffer.-->dragkiste</seg> dufter med violer.</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00004" part="N">Men Fugl <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144713+0200" content="Phønix"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144713+0200"?>Føniks<?oxy_insert_end?> er ikke alene <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144642+0200" content="a"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144642+0200"?>A<?oxy_insert_end?>rabiens fugl, den flagrer i nordlys<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145131+0200" content="-"?>skær på Laplands issletter, den hopper imellem de gule blomster i Grønlands korte sommer. Under <seg target="txtcmnt-488-04" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Fahlun(s)--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: by i Dalarne, Sverige.--><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145341+0200" content="fahluns"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145341+0200"?>Faluns<?oxy_insert_end?></seg> kobberklipper, i Englan<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145426+0200"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>s kulgruber flyver den<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145448+0200" content=","?> som et pudret møl hen over sangbogen i den fromme arbejders hænder. Den sejler på lotusbladet ned ad <seg target="txtcmnt-488-05" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Ganges--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: indisk flod.--><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145510+0200" content="g"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145509+0200"?>G<?oxy_insert_end?>anges<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145547+0200"?>’<?oxy_insert_end?></seg> hellige vande og hindupigens øje lyser ved at se den.<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144720+0200" content=" –"?></p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00005" part="N">Fugl <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144710+0200" content="Phønix"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144710+0200"?>Føniks<?oxy_insert_end?>! Kender du ham ikke? Paradisets fugl, sangens hellige <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T145713+0200" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T145713+0200"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>vane! På <seg target="txtcmnt-488-06" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Thesbiskarren--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: thespiskærren. Thespis fra Ikaria regnes for grundlæggeren af den græske tragedie og skal ifølge sagnet have kørt landet rundt og opført tragedier med alt tilbehøret læsset på en kærre.--><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151216+0200" content="t"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151216+0200"?>T<?oxy_insert_end?>hes<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151144+0200" content="b"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151144+0200"?>p<?oxy_insert_end?>is<?oxy_comment_start author="fgj" timestamp="20231221T125903+0100" comment="-kærren"?>karren<?oxy_comment_end?></seg> sad den som en slad<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151231+0200" content="d"?>rende ravn og slog med de <seg target="txtcmnt-488-07" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: bærme(besmurte)--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: bundfald i gærede drikke.-->bærmebesmurte</seg> vinger; over Islands sanger<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151300+0200" content="-"?>harpe gled <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151308+0200" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151308+0200"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>vanens røde, klingende næb; på <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144658+0200" content="s"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144657+0200"?>S<?oxy_insert_end?>hak<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144655+0200"?>e<?oxy_insert_end?>spear<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151317+0200"?>e<?oxy_insert_end?>s skulder sad den som <seg target="txtcmnt-488-08" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Odins Ravn--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: ifølge nordisk mytologi sidder ravnene Hugin og Munin på Odins skuldre. Hver dag flyver ravnene ud i verden og hvisker ved deres hjemkomst Odin i øret, hvad de har erfaret.-->Odins ravn</seg> og hviskede ham i øret: Udødelighed; den fløj ved <seg target="txtcmnt-488-09" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Sangerfesten … Riddersal--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: hentydning til digterkappestriden, der ifølge sagnet fandt sted på Wartburg i 1207 på foranstaltning af landgreve Hermann af Thüringen.-->sangerfesten gennem Wartburgs riddersal</seg>.</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00006" part="N">Fugl <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144806+0200" content="Phønix"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144806+0200"?>Føniks<?oxy_insert_end?>! Kender du ham ikke? Han sang dig <seg target="txtcmnt-488-10" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Marseillaisen--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: oprindelig krigssang, med melodi og tekst af Claude-Joseph Rouget de Lisle, 1792; siden 1795 Frankrigs nationalsang.--><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151402+0200" content="m"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151402+0200"?>M<?oxy_insert_end?>arseillaisen</seg><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151409+0200"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?> og du kyssede fj<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144757+0200" content="æ"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144757+0200"?>e<?oxy_insert_end?>ren<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151417+0200" content=","?> der faldt fra hans vinge<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151420+0200"?>.<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151421+0200" content="; h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151421+0200"?> H<?oxy_insert_end?>an kom i paradisglans<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151431+0200"?>,<?oxy_insert_end?> og du vendte dig måske bort til spurven<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151434+0200" content=","?> der sad med <seg target="txtcmnt-488-11" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Bog-Guld--><!--DATA-DEFINITION: bladguld, guld udhamret i tynde plader.-->bog<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151438+0200" content="-"?>guld</seg> på vingerne.</p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00007" part="N">Paradisets fugl! Fornyet hvert århundred<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151446+0200"?>e<?oxy_insert_end?>, født i flammer, <pb n="489"/><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151451+0200" content="D"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151451+0200"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>ød i flammer, dit billed<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144752+0200"?>e<?oxy_insert_end?> indfattet i guld hænger i de riges sale, selv flyver du tit vildfaren og ensom<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151505+0200" content=","?> – et sagn kun: »Fugl <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144746+0200" content="Phønix"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144746+0200"?>Føniks<?oxy_insert_end?> i <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144750+0200" content="a"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144749+0200"?>A<?oxy_insert_end?>rabien<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151515+0200" content="."?>«<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151516+0200"?>.<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144754+0200" content=" –"?></p>

<p rend="firstIndent" xml:id="p_00008" part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151531+0200" content="– "?>I <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151539+0200" content="p"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151539+0200"?>P<?oxy_insert_end?>aradisets <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151542+0200" content="h"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151541+0200"?>H<?oxy_insert_end?>ave<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151548+0200" content=","?> da du fødtes under kundskabstræet<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151554+0200" content=","?> i den første rose, kyssede <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144736+0200" content="v"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T144735+0200"?>V<?oxy_insert_end?>or<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T144734+0200" content=" "?>herre dig og gav dig dit rette navn – <?oxy_comment_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151627+0200" comment="kursiv i orig. " id="azz_t3n_vzb"?><?oxy_comment_start author="fgj" timestamp="20231221T130015+0100" parentID="azz_t3n_vzb" comment="stort P er rigeligt" mid="4"?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20230823T151608+0200" content="p"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20230823T151606+0200"?>P<?oxy_insert_end?>oesien<?oxy_comment_end mid="4"?><?oxy_comment_end?>.</p>



<pb n="490"/>
